339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 137 0 R
/T (The Bluestock Mutual Fund Analytics project successfully combined Python, Pandas, SQLite, and Power BI to analyse mutual fund performance, risk, investor behaviour, SIP trends, and portfolio concentration. The project produced advanced analytical outputs such as VaR, CVaR, rolling Sharpe ratio, investor cohorts, SIP continuation risk, fund recommendations, and sector HHI. The Power BI dashboard converted these findings into an interactive reporting solution with slicers, tooltips, and drill-through functionality. Overall, the project demonstrates how data analytics can support better fund comparison, risk assessment, investor understanding, and data-driven decision-making.)
/E (The Bluestock Mutual Fund Analytics project successfully combined Python, Pandas, SQLite, and Power BI to analyse mutual fund performance, risk, investor behaviour, SIP trends, and portfolio concentration. The project produced advanced analytical outputs such as VaR, CVaR, rolling Sharpe ratio, investor cohorts, SIP continuation risk, fund recommendations, and sector HHI. The Power BI dashboard converted these findings into an interactive reporting solution with slicers, tooltips, and drill-through functionality. Overall, the project demonstrates how data analytics can support better fund comparison, risk assessment, investor understanding, and data-driven decision-making.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
