/Title (The analysis is based on the datasets provided for the project and therefore depends on their coverage, accuracy, and completeness. Historical performance and risk metrics do not guarantee future fund performance. Some investor and market factors may not be available in the datasets and therefore were not included in the analysis.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 351 0 R
/Next 632 0 R
>>
endobj
632 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Bluestock Mutual Fund Analytics project successfully combined Python, Pandas, SQLite, and Power BI to analyse mutual fund performance, risk, investor behaviour, SIP trends, and portfolio concentration. The project produced advanced analytical outputs such as VaR, CVaR, rolling Sharpe ratio, investor cohorts, SIP continuation risk, fund recommendations, and sector HHI. The Power BI dashboard converted these findings into an interactive reporting solution with slicers, tooltips, and drill-through functionality. Overall, the project demonstrates how data analytics can support better fund comparison, risk assessment, investor understanding, and data-driven decision-making.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 351 0 R
/Prev 631 0 R
>>
